# MAD 1 (Modern Application Development 1) Project Guidelines

## Roo Code Adherence & Engineering Standards
1. Follow GDD, Ralph Loop, and CodeRabbit quality gates strictly.
2. Maintain durable state on disk across iterations in PRD.md and progress.txt.
3. Every completed milestone must pass verification tests and auto-push to GitHub origin.
4. Ensure real functionality only - no fake dashboards or placeholder data.
5. Provide accessible, high-contrast, responsive IIT Madras CBT interface.
6. Verify verbatim question extraction and 150-DPI visual question card captures.
